>===== Original Message From Ford Chris - cford <Chris.Ford@acxiom.com> =====
Without looking at your partition table, it sounds like you don't have
enough room to write out the LSM info in dsk0h.  Try resizing the dsk0b and
leave like 2MB free for dsk0h.  That's big, you actually only need 16k but 1
or 2 MB is easier.  When you add the disk to LSM and build the mirror it
writes the LSM info to the h partition.  Hope this helps.

Chris Ford
