Thanks to all who replied.  Since I did not have accounting turned on and I
was looking at past activity of accounts, I was limited to using information
in the utmp and wtmp files.  This worked for me.  I simply created a script
that said ==> last username |head and I checked the dates that it returned.
Granted having the year included would have been nice.
 
I had several suggestions that would help in the future ranging from
enabling accounting to adding a touch .lastlogin to the .profile.  All valid
and well appreciated suggestions.
 
Thanks again!
 
John Joehnk
 
 
