collect statistics I noticed that free memory dips into the 20-50 page range and
I'm getting 30-150 page/outs per second on occasion during that time.  I have
the default values for UBC also, will changing these help.  The swapping has
been set to lazy, the application notes claim this will give better performance.

Oh BTW..

