Admins,

 

I have been asked to write a script (ksh) that will defragment each ADVFS
domain in turn (after having closed down all applications, removed users and
inserted the /etc/nologin file). Once the defragment is complete, reboot the
servers.

System environment is ES40 Tru64 5.1 PK3, TruCluster 5.1 and StorageWorks
via HSZ70

 

In principle I have no difficulty in coding this but in view of the
potential risks I was wondering whether any of you could provide advice,
identify "gotchas" etc. TIA

 

 

Kind regards 

Lawrie Smith 
Capita Technical Services 
West Malling 

email:  lawrie.smith@capita.co.uk 
Tel:    01732 877266 

 



